      "id": "u_9a4f4a55bd33d77322a94a8e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since a single note can appear into multiple places in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ via a process called __TRILIUM_PH_2__Cloning Notes__TRILIUM_PH_3__, it's recommended to choose a generalized name that fits into all locations instead of something more specific to avoid confusion.",
