      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a42abef7859f889a78c15d91_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In some cases this isn't possible so Trilium provides \"branch prefixes\", which is shown before the note name in the tree and as such provides a specific kind of context.",
